{"id":"f13b228413db1156","group":"72","path":"72/72-lem-gl-canonical-successor.md","title":"Canonical successor for a missing box","display":"lem-gl-canonical-successor — Canonical successor for a missing box","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-lem-gl-canonical-successor","aliases":["72-lem-gl-canonical-successor"],"display":"lem-gl-canonical-successor — Canonical successor for a missing box","depends_on":["[[72-df-finite-gl-canonical-model]]","[[72-df-modal-adequate-set]]","[[72-thm-gl-derivation-principles]]"],"source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Elsevier, 1998, ISBN 0-444-89840-9","source_location":"Chapter VII, proof of Theorem 2.4, L case and its consistency argument, printed pp. 479–480, PDF pp. 491–492","source_statement_checked":true,"proof_status":"proved-in-note; source-statement-checked","source_proof_status":"source consistency construction checked; complete local boxed-lifting argument supplied","verification_status":"local-proof-checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-lem-gl-canonical-successor"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-lem-gl-canonical-successor</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-gl-canonical-successor — Canonical successor for a missing box"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a84520417d5eb9a3\" href=\"?note=a84520417d5eb9a3\" title=\"72-df-finite-gl-canonical-model\">72-df-finite-gl-canonical-model</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"67a60f891de62bc0\" href=\"?note=67a60f891de62bc0\" title=\"72-df-modal-adequate-set\">72-df-modal-adequate-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"63e851a45e23ff73\" href=\"?note=63e851a45e23ff73\" title=\"72-thm-gl-derivation-principles\">72-thm-gl-derivation-principles</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Elsevier, 1998, ISBN 0-444-89840-9"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Chapter VII, proof of Theorem 2.4, L case and its consistency argument, printed pp. 479–480, PDF pp. 491–492"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"true"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"proved-in-note; source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"source consistency construction checked; complete local boxed-lifting argument supplied"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"local-proof-checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"a84520417d5eb9a3\" href=\"?note=a84520417d5eb9a3\" title=\"72-df-finite-gl-canonical-model\">72-df-finite-gl-canonical-model</a> 的有限 adequate set <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi\">\\(\\Phi\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W_\\Phi,R_\\Phi,\\Delta_\\Phi\">\\(W_\\Phi,R_\\Phi,\\Delta_\\Phi\\)</span>，并使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"63e851a45e23ff73\" href=\"?note=63e851a45e23ff73\" title=\"72-thm-gl-derivation-principles\">72-thm-gl-derivation-principles</a> 的演绎、方框提升及方框假设规则。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w\\in W_\\Phi\">\\(w\\in W_\\Phi\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\\in\\mathcal F_m\">\\(C\\in\\mathcal F_m\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box_m C\\in\\Phi\\setminus w\">\\(\\Box_m C\\in\\Phi\\setminus w\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c_m\">\\(c_m\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Con}_{\\mathsf{GL}}\">\\(\\operatorname{Con}_{\\mathsf{GL}}\\)</span> 使用上述定义的精确接口。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Con}_{\\mathsf{GL}}\\left(\\Delta_\\Phi(w)\\cup\\{\\Box_m C,c_m(C)\\}\\right)\n\\ \\land\\\n\\exists v\\in W_\\Phi\\;\\bigl(R_\\Phi(w,v)\\ \\land\\ c_m(C)\\in v\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Con}_{\\mathsf{GL}}\\left(\\Delta_\\Phi(w)\\cup\\{\\Box_m C,c_m(C)\\}\\right)\n\\ \\land\\\n\\exists v\\in W_\\Phi\\;\\bigl(R_\\Phi(w,v)\\ \\land\\ c_m(C)\\in v\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S=\\Delta_\\Phi(w)\\cup\\{\\Box_m C,c_m(C)\\}\">\\(S=\\Delta_\\Phi(w)\\cup\\{\\Box_m C,c_m(C)\\}\\)</span>。adequacy 保证 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\subseteq\\Phi\">\\(S\\subseteq\\Phi\\)</span>。假设 S 不一致，演绎定理和经典命题推理给出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_\\Phi(w)\\vdash_{\\mathsf{GL}}(\\Box_m C\\to_m C)\">\\(\\Delta_\\Phi(w)\\vdash_{\\mathsf{GL}}(\\Box_m C\\to_m C)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c_m(C)\">\\(c_m(C)\\)</span> 无论是添否定还是删否定，都与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg_m C\">\\(\\neg_m C\\)</span> 命题等价。</p>\n<p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma=\\{\\Box_m D:\\Box_m D\\in w\\}\">\\(\\Gamma=\\{\\Box_m D:\\Box_m D\\in w\\}\\)</span>。方框提升给出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box_m[\\Delta_\\Phi(w)]\\vdash_{\\mathsf{GL}}\\Box_m(\\Box_m C\\to_m C)\">\\(\\Box_m[\\Delta_\\Phi(w)]\\vdash_{\\mathsf{GL}}\\Box_m(\\Box_m C\\to_m C)\\)</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_\\Phi(w)\">\\(\\Delta_\\Phi(w)\\)</span> 的每个成员 E，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\">\\(\\Gamma\\)</span> 都推出 □E：若 E 是某个内容 D，则 □D 已在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\">\\(\\Gamma\\)</span>；若 E 是 □D，则用 4 从 □D 推出 □□D。因此 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash_{\\mathsf{GL}}\\Box_m(\\Box_m C\\to_m C)\">\\(\\Gamma\\vdash_{\\mathsf{GL}}\\Box_m(\\Box_m C\\to_m C)\\)</span>，再用 Löb 公理得到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash_{\\mathsf{GL}}\\Box_m C\">\\(\\Gamma\\vdash_{\\mathsf{GL}}\\Box_m C\\)</span>。因 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\subseteq w\">\\(\\Gamma\\subseteq w\\)</span>，w 也推出 □C。□C 在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi\">\\(\\Phi\\)</span> 中，w 的极大一致性便强迫 □C 属于 w，矛盾。这里最后一步仅用：一致集能推出的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi\">\\(\\Phi\\)</span> 内公式可加入而不破坏一致性。</p>\n<p>所以 S 一致。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi\">\\(\\Phi\\)</span> 有限，选择包含 S 的一致子集并逐项加入可加入的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi\">\\(\\Phi\\)</span> 内公式，有限步得到某个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v\\in W_\\Phi\">\\(v\\in W_\\Phi\\)</span>。v 包含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_\\Phi(w)\">\\(\\Delta_\\Phi(w)\\)</span>，并包含不在 w 的 □C，故 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R_\\Phi(w,v)\">\\(R_\\Phi(w,v)\\)</span>；它还包含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c_m(C)\">\\(c_m(C)\\)</span>。关键作用是加入 □C 本身，它保证真后继；只加入其否定内容不足以排除自反。此处复核了来源证明及完整局部推导，没有进行机器证明。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-finite-gl-canonical-model","status":"resolved","id":"a84520417d5eb9a3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-finite-gl-canonical-model]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-modal-adequate-set","status":"resolved","id":"67a60f891de62bc0","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-modal-adequate-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-thm-gl-derivation-principles","status":"resolved","id":"63e851a45e23ff73","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-thm-gl-derivation-principles]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-finite-gl-canonical-model","status":"resolved","id":"a84520417d5eb9a3","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"使用 [[72-df-finite-gl-canonical-model]] 的有限 adequate set $\\Phi$、$W_\\Phi,R_\\Phi,\\Delta_\\Phi$，并使用 [[72-thm-gl-derivation-principles]] 的演绎、方框提升及方框假设规则。","embed":false},{"target":"72-thm-gl-derivation-principles","status":"resolved","id":"63e851a45e23ff73","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"使用 [[72-df-finite-gl-canonical-model]] 的有限 adequate set $\\Phi$、$W_\\Phi,R_\\Phi,\\Delta_\\Phi$，并使用 [[72-thm-gl-derivation-principles]] 的演绎、方框提升及方框假设规则。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Phi","display":false},{"tex":"W_\\Phi,R_\\Phi,\\Delta_\\Phi","display":false},{"tex":"w\\in W_\\Phi","display":false},{"tex":"C\\in\\mathcal F_m","display":false},{"tex":"\\Box_m C\\in\\Phi\\setminus w","display":false},{"tex":"c_m","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Con}_{\\mathsf{GL}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Con}_{\\mathsf{GL}}\\left(\\Delta_\\Phi(w)\\cup\\{\\Box_m C,c_m(C)\\}\\right)\n\\ \\land\\\n\\exists v\\in W_\\Phi\\;\\bigl(R_\\Phi(w,v)\\ \\land\\ c_m(C)\\in v\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"S=\\Delta_\\Phi(w)\\cup\\{\\Box_m C,c_m(C)\\}","display":false},{"tex":"S\\subseteq\\Phi","display":false},{"tex":"\\Delta_\\Phi(w)\\vdash_{\\mathsf{GL}}(\\Box_m C\\to_m C)","display":false},{"tex":"c_m(C)","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg_m C","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma=\\{\\Box_m D:\\Box_m D\\in w\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Box_m[\\Delta_\\Phi(w)]\\vdash_{\\mathsf{GL}}\\Box_m(\\Box_m C\\to_m C)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Delta_\\Phi(w)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma\\vdash_{\\mathsf{GL}}\\Box_m(\\Box_m C\\to_m C)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma\\vdash_{\\mathsf{GL}}\\Box_m C","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma\\subseteq w","display":false},{"tex":"\\Phi","display":false},{"tex":"\\Phi","display":false},{"tex":"\\Phi","display":false},{"tex":"\\Phi","display":false},{"tex":"v\\in W_\\Phi","display":false},{"tex":"\\Delta_\\Phi(w)","display":false},{"tex":"R_\\Phi(w,v)","display":false},{"tex":"c_m(C)","display":false}],"bytes":2845,"backlinks":[{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-330","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-lem-gl-canonical-successor|lem-gl-canonical-successor — Canonical successor for a missing box]]"},{"id":"70ff58eeae2491db","anchor":"ref-328","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[lem-gl-canonical-successor — Canonical successor for a missing box](72-lem-gl-canonical-successor.md)"},{"id":"a84520417d5eb9a3","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"这是原书有限 adequate set 上的 L 典范构造，不能用全部极大一致集的通常无限典范模型代替。关系除了传递方框及其内容，还要求严格增加至少一个方框公式；这一额外条件给有限框架的非自反性。由于 $\\Phi$ 对子公式封闭，$\\Delta_\\Phi(w)\\subseteq\\Phi$。所有构造都由分离、幂集和有限集操作给出；$V_\\Phi:\\omega\\to\\mathcal P(W_\\Phi)$ 唯一确定。这里先定义三元组，不预先假定其非空性或真值引理；这些证明在 [[72-lem-gl-canonical-successor]] 与 [[72-thm-gl-finite-completeness]] 中给出。Remark 中这两条链接是后续导航，不是定义依赖。"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-352","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./72-lem-gl-canonical-successor|lem-gl-canonical-successor — Canonical successor for a missing box]]"},{"id":"d40b90e274cadbda","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"使用 [[72-lem-gl-canonical-successor]] 及其上游的 $\\mathcal F_m,\\Phi_A,\\operatorname{Adeq}_m,W_\\Phi,R_\\Phi,V_\\Phi,\\mathcal M_\\Phi$；$\\Phi$ 是任意有限 adequate set，$A\\in\\mathcal F_m$。"},{"id":"29de2a641cbd0b98","anchor":"ref-380","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../72-lem-gl-canonical-successor]]"}],"outgoing":["a84520417d5eb9a3","67a60f891de62bc0","63e851a45e23ff73"]}